## Color tokens

Colors are **space-separated RGB channels** (no commas) — applied as CSS variables:

```css
--orbit-canvas: 15 20 38;
background: rgb(var(--orbit-canvas));
```

| Token | CSS variable | Usage |
| ----- | ------------ | ----- |
| `canvas` | `--orbit-canvas` | App background, artwork scrims |
| `surface` | `--orbit-surface` | Inputs / nested surfaces, wallpaper gradient |
| `panel` | `--orbit-panel` | Cards and glass panels |
| `foreground` | `--orbit-foreground` | Primary text |
| `muted` | `--orbit-muted` | Secondary text |
| `accent` | `--orbit-accent` | CTA / highlights, wallpaper glow |
| `focus` | `--orbit-focus` | Controller focus ring |
| `border` | `--orbit-border` | Subtle borders |

Applied at runtime by `theme.store.ts` when user selects a theme. `macos.css` reads these variables for the wallpaper, hero/detail scrims, and primary button text, using the fixed Liquid Glass palette. Stored legacy palettes are not applied. The store also sets `html[data-theme]`, `html[data-theme-kind]`, and `--theme-wallpaper`.

Liquid Glass retains its original palette: canvas `15 20 38`, surface `28 35 56`, panel `32 42 68`, foreground `246 248 255`, muted `171 186 211`, accent `134 193 255`, focus `189 222 255`, border `73 90 124`. The warm redesign and platform presets were reverted.

### Theme JSON shape

```typescript
interface ThemeDefinition {
  id: string
  name: string
  description?: string
  author?: string
  fonts?: { display?: string; body?: string }
  colors: ThemeColors
  radius?: string
  cardRadius?: string
  kind?: 'color' | 'game' | 'custom'
  blur?: string
  motion?: { duration?: string; easing?: string }
  branding?: {
    logoText?: string       // legacy, not rendered
    logoStyle?: 'clean' | 'serif' | 'gothic' | 'glitch' | 'heavy' | 'neon' | 'rounded'
    logoImage?: string      // inline raster data URL
    wallpaper?: string      // inline raster data URL
    tagline?: string
    artworkQuery?: string
  }
}
```

See [docs/THEMES.md](THEMES.md) for authoring walkthrough.

