## Layout

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Theme logo     [ Play Library Search Set ] + ⤢ │  floating Liquid Glass header
│                                             │
│  Hero copy + Jump back in / Details         │  selected game's hero art full-bleed
│  Your next escape ─► tile tile tile tile    │
│ tagline            ORBIT          A Select  │  footer (ORBIT mark on branded themes)
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- `MacosShell.tsx` — header (`ThemeBrand`, navigation, utilities), wallpaper, routed content, footer
- `MacosHome.tsx` — feature hero and rounded horizontal shelf. `ShellBackdrop.tsx` keeps the previous artwork visible while the replacement decodes, then crossfades. The header keeps the active theme’s branding.
- `ThemePage.tsx` — shared content container for non-home routes; page titles and eyebrows are owned by the shell, not duplicated per page

