## Artwork conventions

Game artwork is stored as filesystem paths under `artwork-cache/` when possible (http(s) URLs and small inline Base64 remain valid in `artwork_json`):

| Slot | Key | Typical use |
| ---- | --- | ----------- |
| Cover | `cover` | Square / portrait box art |
| Hero | `hero` | Landscape background |
| Logo | `logo` | Title treatment overlay; theme studio header logo (SteamGridDB `logos`, Steam Store `logo.png`) |
| Icon | `icon` | Small grid thumbnail |

Heavy inline Base64 is spilled to cache on save / library list so home and library tiles keep images without multi-MB IPC payloads.

Hero tone derived from artwork via `useHeroTone` for adaptive scrims.

